{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3533249","formula":"C₁₅H₁₀O₅","hill":"C15H10O5","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":10.0,"O":5.0},"names":{"en":"Aloe emodin","ru":"Алоэ-эмодин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Aloe emodin (1,8-dihydroxy-3-(hydroxymethyl)anthraquinone) is an anthraquinone and an isomer of emodin present in aloe latex, an exudate from the aloe plant. It has a strong stimulant-laxative action. Aloe emodin is not carcinogenic when applied to the skin, although it may increase the carcinogenicity of some kinds of radiation.","ru":"Алоэ-эмодин — химическое соединение с химической формулой C15H10O5, изомер эмодина, производное антрахинона. Присутствует в млечном соке алоэ, экстракт из растения алоэ. Он обладает сильным стимуляторным-слабительным действием."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":10207,"mass":270.24,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC2=C(C(=C1)O)C(=O)C3=C(C2=O)C=C(C=C3O)CO","inchikey":"YDQWDHRMZQUTBA-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,8-dihydroxy-3-(hydroxymethyl)anthracene-9,10-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"10207","atoms":30,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.552,"y":-2.953,"z":-0.058,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.952,"y":-2.424,"z":0.044,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.035,"y":2.837,"z":-0.142,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.486,"y":-2.066,"z":0.151,"el":"O"},{"x":5.165,"y":0.961,"z":1.012,"el":"O"},{"x":0.879,"y":0.673,"z":-0.126,"el":"C"},{"x":0.64,"y":-0.702,"z":-0.077,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.866,"y":-0.261,"z":0.026,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.626,"y":1.114,"z":-0.023,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.742,"y":-1.219,"z":0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.245,"y":1.631,"z":-0.101,"el":"C"},{"x":2.193,"y":1.151,"z":-0.2,"el":"C"},{"x":1.714,"y":-1.599,"z":-0.102,"el":"C"},{"x":3.261,"y":0.253,"z":-0.224,"el":"C"},{"x":3.022,"y":-1.119,"z":-0.175,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.18,"y":-0.739,"z":0.099,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.7,"y":2.011,"z":0